kyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/91006211/8e4da0e8002697002d188bc4f7bb8e94_2416001331800750474.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提供物理伤害的可肝拳套，主动被动均提供一定物理伤害，可供物理拳套角色过渡。主动可使敌人减速，触发白夜执事和影骑士·月轮的被动从而稍微提升输出。可惜培养成本过高，且同为五星的太虚之握在培养成本和伤害加成方面均优于星环，因此不推荐升星。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/91006211/8e4da0e8002697002d188bc4f7bb8e94_2416001331800750474.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
